edits.new:
Each foot (h_f 2.19 mm) is taped to the carrier with
  0.05 mm acrylic transfer tape, gap-checked dry before the 22 MB joints were soldered, and bedded on the polyimide sheet
  in a flowable alkoxy-cure RTV (nominal 0.30 mm, gated 0.15-0.45 mm) after them;

) and the first-mode estimates (H.23(i), H.23(j)) (**superseded in r7:** and the
    foot height h_f 2.24 mm; t_bed does not depend on the MB or CR thickness, because the header bodies and the feet both stand
    on the sheet, and PM4 (2d) gates it).
